# nothing saved (a first start, or another firmware's save): GX-1 makes a first idea on the GEN page, so PLAY (or a
# DAW's start) plays its parts on 1, 5, 7 and 8, not SEQ-4's demo (drums on 10)
wait 500
expect view 5
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect playing 1
expect chnotes10 0
expect chnotes1 >3
expect chnotes5 >0
expect chnotes7 >0
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
